<body>
    <h1>My Python Web App</h1>
    <p>Welcome to my Week 2 project!</p>

    <div class="counter">
        <h2>Total page visits</h2>
        <strong>{{ visits }}</strong>
    </div>

    <h2>How does it work?</h2>
    <p>This website uses Python Flask and MariaDB.</p>
    <p>Each page load increases the counter by one.
       The count is stored in a MariaDB database.</p>

